# C4 System Context Diagram — Mandukya AI

> System Context (Level 1) — Shows the system in scope and its relationships with users and external systems.

```mermaid
C4Context
    title System Context — Mandukya AI (Video Analysis Pipeline)

    Person(user, "User / Student", "A learner who wants to study educational videos deeply")

    System_Boundary(b0, "Mandukya AI System") {
        System(pipeline, "Python Pipeline", "Downloads, transcribes, indexes, and searches video content")
        System(frontend, "React Frontend (Split-Helix UI)", "3D interactive UI for browsing lessons, transcripts, and knowledge graphs")
        SystemDb(kg, "Knowledge Graph", "Cognee-managed RDBMS + Vector + Graph databases (Kùzu, LanceDB)")
        SystemDb(fs, "File System", "Transcripts, frames, slides, diagrams stored on disk")
    }

    System_Ext(youtube, "YouTube", "Source of educational video content")
    System_Ext(ollama, "Ollama (Local LLM)", "Local LLM for reasoning, insights, and diagram generation")
    System_Ext(whisper, "Whisper.cpp", "Local audio-to-text transcription engine")
    System_Ext(ffmpeg, "FFmpeg", "Video frame extraction and audio processing")
    System_Ext(revealjs, "Reveal.js", "Presentation framework for generated slides")

    Rel(user, pipeline, "Runs commands via Make CLI", "CLI")
    Rel(user, frontend, "Interacts with 3D UI", "Browser")
    Rel(pipeline, youtube, "Downloads videos", "yt-dlp")
    Rel(pipeline, whisper, "Sends audio for transcription", "CLI call")
    Rel(pipeline, ffmpeg, "Extracts frames and audio", "CLI call")
    Rel(pipeline, ollama, "Requests insights and diagrams", "HTTP API")
    Rel(pipeline, kg, "Stores and queries knowledge", "Cognee API")
    Rel(pipeline, fs, "Reads/writes artifacts", "File I/O")
    Rel(frontend, kg, "Queries knowledge graph", "Database")
    Rel(frontend, fs, "Reads transcripts and slides", "File I/O")
    Rel(fs, revealjs, "Renders slides", "HTML/JS")

    UpdateRelStyle(user, pipeline, $offsetY="-40")
    UpdateRelStyle(user, frontend, $offsetY="40")
    UpdateRelStyle(pipeline, youtube, $offsetX="-60")
    UpdateRelStyle(pipeline, ollama, $offsetX="60")
```

## Legend

| Element | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **Person** | Human user interacting with the system |
| **System** | Software systems within the Mandukya AI boundary |
| **SystemDb** | Data stores (databases, file systems) |
| **System_Ext** | External systems the pipeline depends on |
| **Rel** | Relationship/interaction between elements |

## Notes

- All external systems (Ollama, Whisper.cpp, FFmpeg) run **locally** — no cloud dependencies.
- The pipeline and frontend share data through the file system and knowledge graph — no REST API layer.
- YouTube is the only external network dependency (for video downloads).
